SICM-A2 - Pending and paused SCM states are not handled
Severity: Major (P1). Category: MustChange/rewrite. Checklist: error handling. Locations: ControladorServicios.cs:42 (../../SWIFT/Incoming/SWF_IN_ControladorServiciosMQ/Aplicacion/Service/ControladorServicios.cs#L42), :84 (../../SWIFT/Incoming/SWF_IN_ControladorServiciosMQ/Aplicacion/Service/ControladorServicios.cs#L84).
